    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="title" data-i18n="ap_h">One discipline, two layers</h2>
      <p class="intro" data-i18n="ap_intro">Behavioral data science is not a separate field in my work. It is industrial and organizational psychology, taken further with data.</p>
